  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Clinique Vétérinaire MyVet Port Vauban, at 9 rue Ernest Macé in Antibes, joined the national MyVet network in January 2023, moving into new premises at the time. Its central location — a stone's throw from place de Gaulle, Vieux Antibes, Port Vauban and the train station — makes it a handy address if you're passing through central Antibes with your dog. Reviews are generally positive (fast help, good value, dedicated team).</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>The listed opening hours are Monday to Friday from 9am to 12pm then 2pm to 7pm, and Saturday from 9am to 2pm. The clinic is closed on Sunday. Remember to call before coming, especially towards the end of the week.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: save the clinic's number in your phone as soon as you arrive in Antibes, it can come in handy if something unexpected comes up during opening hours.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>Port Vauban and the old town of Antibes are a few minutes' walk away.</p>
